content:
To achieve high search throughput and zero index bloat, I recommend an SQLite database in WAL mode with an FTS5 virtual table synchronized via automatic triggers.

Here is the proposed schema:
```sql
CREATE TABLE messages (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, conversation_id TEXT, step_index INTEGER, content TEXT, tool_names TEXT);
CREATE VIRTUAL TABLE messages_fts USING fts5(content, tool_names, tokenize = 'porter unicode61');
```
